incident here in in downtown

00:12:39.235 --> 00:12:43.310
a couple weeks ago, something
on a Wednesday that was totally

00:12:43.310 --> 00:12:47.390
unexpected, and we we
had to evacuate downtown.

00:12:47.390 --> 00:12:51.390
