building as quick as you can,

00:12:56.335 --> 00:12:59.135
and it took a lot of effort
to help make that happen.

00:12:59.135 --> 00:13:01.775
I know it was the the
sheriff's office initially that came over

00:13:01.775 --> 00:13:03.695
