learned some lessons about how

00:13:06.815 --> 00:13:08.095
we can communicate better,

00:13:08.095 --> 00:13:10.575
and and hopefully nothing
like that ever happens again.

00:13:10.575 --> 00:13:13.780
But if it does, we are prepared
and and ready for that.

00:13:13.780 --> 00:13:16.580
But there were a lot of members
of the team that helped to make

00:13:16.580 --> 00:13:19.140
sure that we were
safe throughout that event,

00:13:19.140 --> 00:13:22.060
so I wanna recognize
town staff for that.

00:13:22.420 --> 00:13:25.700
And then July twentieth was
