00:17:24.295 --> 00:17:26.535
Mister mayor, our first
speaker tonight is miss Ellen,

00:17:26.535 --> 00:17:29.695
and I apologize if I pronounced
his name incorrectly, Dykle.

00:17:37.400 --> 00:17:42.000
So good evening. I'm Ellen
Dykell from ward one.

00:17:43.635 --> 00:17:44.675
Hey.

00:17:44.675 --> 00:17:48.115
So last month, the council
proposed drafting an ordinance

00:17:48.115 --> 00:17:52.555
to restrict e scooter and e bike
usage due to safety concerns.

00:17:53.155 --> 00:17:57.155
In that same discussion,
LSVs and golf carts came up,

00:17:57.155 --> 00:18:01.560
and Roy actually let me know that
that came up again this morning.

00:18:03.120 --> 00:18:07.120
While I'm glad that LSV
usage isn't being restricted

00:18:07.120 --> 00:18:09.935
beyond what Virginia
law already allows,

00:18:09.935 --> 00:18:14.335
I'd like to ask the council to
also consider allowing golf carts.

00:18:14.335 --> 00:18:17.295
The legal difference between
LSVs and golf carts comes down

00:18:17.295 --> 00:18:19.135
to equipment and registration.

00:18:19.135 --> 00:18:22.255
LSVs must be
titled, registered, insured,

00:18:22.255 --> 00:18:24.810
and built with
mirrors, windshield, and wipers.

00:18:24.810 --> 00:18:27.050
Golf carts have none
of that by default,

00:18:27.050 --> 00:18:29.850
which is why they're restricted
unless a town passes an

00:18:29.850 --> 00:18:31.890
ordinance to allow them.

00:18:32.250 --> 00:18:35.050
LSVs are marginally
safer on paper,

00:18:35.050 --> 00:18:38.170
but significantly more
expensive, double the cost or

00:18:38.170 --> 00:18:41.090
more, putting them out of
reach for many residents.

00:18:41.505 --> 00:18:44.945
I don't believe the windshield
wipers or title titling

00:18:44.945 --> 00:18:47.585
meaningfully changes
safety outcomes here.

00:18:47.585 --> 00:18:51.065
The safety gap I do see
is liability insurance.

00:18:51.265 --> 00:18:53.865
Pairing a golf cart

00:18:54.410 --> 00:18:58.170
approved ordinance with
required insurance and

00:18:58.170 --> 00:19:02.010
possibly seat belts would close
that safety gap while keeping

00:19:02.010 --> 00:19:04.050
golf carts affordable.

00:19:04.330 --> 00:19:07.465
I don't think anyone's argued
against golf carts so much

00:19:07.465 --> 00:19:09.705
as no one's made the
case for them yet.

00:19:09.705 --> 00:19:13.065
So let me make it because
that is why I'm here tonight.

00:19:13.065 --> 00:19:16.665
I don't think it's right that
only the families with an extra

00:19:16.665 --> 00:19:21.630
ten grand to spare get to enjoy
getting around Borrenton in this way.

00:19:21.630 --> 00:19:25.070
Beyond affordability, this is
about preserving our small town,

00:19:25.070 --> 00:19:27.950
helping our old town businesses
thrive and keeping our

00:19:27.950 --> 00:19:29.710
community connected.

00:19:29.710 --> 00:19:30.750
So picture this,

00:19:30.750 --> 00:19:33.630
taking your grandkids up to
Main Street in a golf cart for

00:19:33.630 --> 00:19:36.830
an ice cream cone or picture
puttering over to your friend's

00:19:36.830 --> 00:19:40.085
house for a cookout in the
next neighborhood over,

00:19:40.085 --> 00:19:42.765
waving to your neighbors
as you pass by.

00:19:43.045 --> 00:19:46.005
Golf carts give residents
an affordable way to easily

00:19:46.005 --> 00:19:49.285
connect with each other
and to Old Town as Nova

00:19:49.285 --> 00:19:52.370
keeps expanding towards us,
holding on to that family

00:19:52.370 --> 00:19:58.170
friendly classic small town
charm matters more every year.

00:19:59.010 --> 00:20:02.770
Additionally, golf cart
usage would increase

00:20:02.770 --> 00:20:04.985
patronage to our
Old Town businesses.

00:20:04.985 --> 00:20:08.825
Residents are more likely to go
on a whim for dinner or coffee,

00:20:08.825 --> 00:20:11.865
for example, when the ride
itself is part of the fun,

00:20:11.865 --> 00:20:14.225
not just a means to get there.

00:20:14.345 --> 00:20:16.305
Regarding safety impact,

00:20:17.830 --> 00:20:21.350
Some of the benefits are that
it would slow traffic slightly,

00:20:21.350 --> 00:20:23.350
particularly on
Main Street here,

00:20:23.350 --> 00:20:26.790
which would increase pedestrian
awareness and give drivers

00:20:26.790 --> 00:20:30.430
vastly superior visibility over

00:20:31.030 --> 00:20:33.550
drivers in traditional vehicles.

00:20:37.085 --> 00:20:40.845
So in closing, I'd like to
propose to the council to

00:20:40.845 --> 00:20:44.325
consider adopting an
ordinance to allow

00:20:44.445 --> 00:20:45.965
golf carts.

00:20:45.965 --> 00:20:47.045
Thank you.

00:20:49.600 --> 00:20:53.280
And obviously, I did write
down what I had to say.

00:20:53.280 --> 00:20:55.400
Thank you. You.

