to capture what the intent of

00:36:01.045 --> 00:36:05.005
that code is, and I'll
give the example of

00:36:05.525 --> 00:36:08.645
if the town stops
collecting from, say,

00:36:08.645 --> 00:36:11.790
a commercial business
that needs a, you know,

00:36:11.790 --> 00:36:13.790
