00:36:13.790 --> 00:36:15.390
where are they gonna
put that dumpster?

00:36:15.390 --> 00:36:17.230
Is it gonna take
up parking spaces?

00:36:17.230 --> 00:36:18.910
Does it need to be enclosed?

00:36:18.910 --> 00:36:21.390
And and how do we sort
of transition to that?

00:36:21.390 --> 00:36:24.685
And so I pulled our team
together to start working on

00:36:24.685 --> 00:36:28.205
this and and come up with a
transition plan and expect

00:36:28.205 --> 00:36:30.765
within a couple weeks to be
able to report back to you on

00:36:30.765 --> 00:36:33.965
